    "",
    "WHAT THIS FILE IS: an announced national release calendar — when a film",
    "opens in cinemas in India.",
    "",
    "WHAT THIS FILE IS NOT: this cinema's own programme. A release date says a",
    "film opens, not that this venue is screening it, on which screen, at what",
    "time, or in which language version. Those facts come only from the venue's",
    "ticketing feed (see FEED_CONTRACT.md). The site says so on every surface",
    "that shows these titles.",
    "",
    "artwork. Those were not published by the sources used here, and inventing",
    "them would be exactly the kind of invented fact this project forbids. They",
    "appear automatically once a feed or the venue supplies them.",
    "",
    "WHAT IS STILL DELIBERATELY ABSENT PER TITLE: runtime, certification and",
    "synopsis. Those were not published by the sources used here, and inventing",
    "them would be exactly the kind of invented fact this project forbids. They",
    "appear automatically once a feed or the venue supplies them.",
    "",
    "ARTWORK: this file holds no image URLs, on purpose. A film's poster belongs to",
    "its studio, so the site never borrows one; the picture on a card is an original",
    "abstract plate generated for this project, listed in data/cover-art.json, and",
    "the card says so in words. A licensed poster from the venue or the partner feed",
    "always takes precedence over a plate.",
    "",
    "EDITING RULES: add a film only with a published release date and at least",
    "one source. Never add a runtime, certification, synopsis or image URL by",
    "hand — those fields do not exist here on purpose."
